      "page_title": "Async Generators",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What is it?",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Async generator== = `async def` + `yield`",
            "Supports `async for` **automatically**",
            "No need to write `__aiter__` / `__anext__`",
            "Can `await` between yields (I/O per item)"
          ],
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def ticks():",
            "    while True:",
            "        await asyncio.sleep(1)",
            "        yield time.time()",
            "async for t in ticks(): print(t)"
          ],
          "note": "await allowed between yields"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Rules and Methods",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`yield from` inside an async gen → **SyntaxError**",
            "`return value` → **SyntaxError**",
            "Only a bare `return` is allowed"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Method",
            "Effect"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "`asend(v)`",
              "v becomes yield's value"
            ],
            [
              "`athrow(exc)`",
              "raises exc at yield"
            ],
            [
              "`aclose()`",
              "==GeneratorExit== at yield"
            ],
            [
              "→ result",
              "`finally` blocks **run**"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Early break gotcha",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`break` out of `async for` → gen stays **paused**",
            "Its `finally` waits for GC or loop shutdown",
            "Held sockets/files stay open until then",
            "`asyncio.run` calls ==loop.shutdown_asyncgens()== at exit"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "from contextlib import aclosing",
            "async with aclosing(gen()) as g:",
            "    async for x in g:",
            "        if x > 5: break",
            "# aclose() already ran here"
          ],
          "note": "3.10+: cleanup is deterministic"
        },
